"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫Lei aveva assolutamente ragione."

#: badend:badend_DBD2CF6C_607D_4CF7_8EC2_94F7546120B4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cfec3251e79d5460f45db6930495b19d4a522ea41155c3115520091babba6d76
#. default-sha256: 1b35161f12c622c49f3277e92b44db2e4439757e533538bca09125ad02bf9f89
msgctxt "badend:badend_DBD2CF6C_607D_4CF7_8EC2_94F7546120B4"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫You⟪k:2⟫The Departed⟪k:3⟫ had seen an excess of tragedy."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Avevi⟪k:2⟫Il Defunto aveva⟪k:3⟫ visto troppe tragedie."

#: badend:badend_E791CD14_B216_439A_81DB_5B62B7ADC592
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 19acabad3e7bd1d010e320eb290cacd8a9e54c9753cda730b208ac447347a5f2
#. default-sha256: 116eb6b849dd2c9d8d043aeb6ae78fee89b9e011441903ef0bfe96fd907ecd8e
msgctxt "badend:badend_E791CD14_B216_439A_81DB_5B62B7ADC592"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫You⟪k:2⟫He⟪k:3⟫ had borne witness to far too much pain."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Avevi⟪k:2⟫Aveva⟪k:3⟫ assistito a troppo dolore."

#: badend:badend_AF0307E1_ED6B_4762_B4A3_C0E138043E7B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: efedc3792b5cb3d34ca1932d3f3630819fb2d76015fae13ac7960fe0a3cb184c
#. default-sha256: a0a26dd2e3bc768f9645156e296ec2ee114b06a449f1f72579c05ea36e0e88eb
msgctxt "badend:badend_AF0307E1_ED6B_4762_B4A3_C0E138043E7B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And ⟪k:1⟫Your⟪k:2⟫his⟪k:3⟫ spirit was deeply wounded by it."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫E il ⟪k:1⟫Tuo⟪k:2⟫suo⟪k:3⟫ spirito ne era uscito profondamente ferito."

#: badend:badend_66FBD3A0_5A11_44C7_BEFD_B7C18680597A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 12ab5a972ac5ca0e695681c10bcda43398a7bd1a5421a1ae18184aa276c158ed
#. default-sha256: d8e0d896262293746d033bf729da73f1ae630e246203b5d8f3539d7e370e5383
msgctxt "badend:badend_66FBD3A0_5A11_44C7_BEFD_B7C18680597A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫You⟪k:2⟫He⟪k:3⟫ could not possibly endure any further tragedy."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Non saresti⟪k:2⟫Non sarebbe⟪k:3⟫ riuscito in alcun modo a sopportare ulteriori "
"disgrazie."

#: badend:badend_36EFD0B6_09EA_4A1A_85F7_30C6F145ACA6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 71cc87ef70c2b866c5277608ad394e2a73e62a6ab91e7fb1249c3e89e029481e
#. default-sha256: baea4f16e4c11ecdef25a365f0b7fa69aeb125f565ff0b2be862d7e1b71d0190
msgctxt "badend:badend_36EFD0B6_09EA_4A1A_85F7_30C6F145ACA6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And so, if she was offering ⟪k:1⟫You⟪k:2⟫him⟪k:3⟫ relief from all that, perhaps ⟪k:4⟫You⟪k:5⟫"
"he⟪k:6⟫ should accept it."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Perciò, se lei ⟪k:1⟫Ti⟪k:2⟫gli⟪k:3⟫ stava offrendo sollievo da tutto quello, forse ⟪k:4⟫"
"avresti⟪k:5⟫avrebbe⟪k:6⟫ dovuto accettarlo."

#: badend:badend_7C79C15B_9D28_40F4_962C_560B595A0855
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bc97251a9b0d9dfd6abd48edc5f4d240e1831bd5128f2d6b2695063197033afb
#. default-sha256: e8f37759ae794b3ec5631e47684f55970674b9b66b86c23999eccc71c06318cd
msgctxt "badend:badend_7C79C15B_9D28_40F4_962C_560B595A0855"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She had guided ⟪k:1⟫You⟪k:2⟫him⟪k:3⟫ this far, never letting go of ⟪k:4⟫Your⟪k:5⟫his⟪k:6⟫ "
"hand."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Lei ⟪k:1⟫Ti⟪k:2⟫lo⟪k:3⟫ aveva guidato fin lì, senza mai lasciare la ⟪k:4⟫Tua⟪k:5⟫sua⟪k:6⟫ "
"mano."

#: badend:badend_3F2365CC_9CD3_4348_96E8_29A51C38F382
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d5d34f052d323ced1a22fb91252f3634c0c37c027072e005afab9b510373589d
#. default-sha256: b084a29cd90b92adebfc66dbe86a00dae0719c1d638bfa61f936f38813b7dd10
msgctxt "badend:badend_3F2365CC_9CD3_4348_96E8_29A51C38F382"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And it was her presence that had allowed ⟪k:1⟫You⟪k:2⟫him⟪k:3⟫ to bear the bleak, "
"disheartening, and wretched tales ⟪k:4⟫You⟪k:5⟫he⟪k:6⟫ saw."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ed era stata la sua presenza ad aver⟪k:1⟫ti⟪k:2⟫gli⟪k:3⟫ permesso di sopportare gli "
"infelici, tetri e scoraggianti racconti che ⟪k:4⟫avevi⟪k:5⟫aveva⟪k:6⟫ vissuto."

#: badend:badend_77AE4EFD_0BEB_42E1_A52B_C9808F0E84A9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ce97a73d116728d35b410509c35bd1e613d2220545e5f6fbc4f64b6fa1e65032
#. default-sha256: 7c23fffac75f68a748474122fc1a5be4650aaab4b71852017d5ad2b692b29b8a
msgctxt "badend:badend_77AE4EFD_0BEB_42E1_A52B_C9808F0E84A9"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Did ⟪k:1⟫You⟪k:2⟫the Departed⟪k:3⟫ really need anything other than her?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Avevi⟪k:2⟫Il Defunto aveva⟪k:3⟫ realmente bisogno di altro all’infuori di lei?"

#: badend:badend_264B638E_F9ED_4D3A_86F9_5DD7FC3FEA53
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 08fa29d1bb35c60ef90935cce7295370e521d77ef5c968e3936b4603d6c30fa0
#. default-sha256: 03077e35e5996b9db4044680dae64ac511736b234de08812709da470de736417
msgctxt "badend:badend_264B638E_F9ED_4D3A_86F9_5DD7FC3FEA53"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫If she said she wanted to be with ⟪k:1⟫You⟪k:2⟫him⟪k:3⟫,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Se lei voleva rimanere con ⟪k:1⟫Te⟪k:2⟫lui⟪k:3⟫,"

#: badend:badend_0C20D1B3_0A24_4DBB_B857_152286353C56
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4a410f72ec7a54cd9dfae7702b729c536cefb6a633bb6d3ed824c57be0ab5c26
#. default-sha256: ebd962f66bf5e3a6b1e29b8a60a2e188d8e352e1f347e38062c3277e93e0c25d
