msgid "⟪k:0⟫then surely ⟪k:1⟫You were⟪k:2⟫he was⟪k:3⟫ allowed to want the same."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫allora di certo ⟪k:1⟫Ti era⟪k:2⟫gli era⟪k:3⟫ permesso desiderare la stessa cosa."

#: badend:badend_DA85CFA1_92FA_46A7_9F1A_A7666E361742
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 77d8698f0c8a10c92c90b499b3fa0a4461329eb1027f66099b327d89c833235e
