msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Grasp my hand, Master...⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Come, hold it tight."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Afferri la mia mano, Padrone...⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Su, la tenga stretta."

#: badend:badend_3915BB6B_3C00_441F_BA02_CACC127487F6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
