msgctxt "badend:badend_29D46658_3C72_4F60_8EBD_02064AC70CDB"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Oh, thank goodness. You have awoken.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫I was getting worried there for a moment."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Oh, grazie al cielo. Si è svegliata.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Per un attimo mi stavo preoccupando."

#: badend:badend_9DC2F38C_144D_445D_AC6E_F7CB12141173
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9d8e10716530ff57afa72c174298403a87105fa9653c5996ffc2dab8780263ce
#. default-sha256: fc1a51f5e2cfe9988c198ee62702ceca7b1d7e7614cf07478fb3bee86399eec7
msgctxt "badend:badend_9DC2F38C_144D_445D_AC6E_F7CB12141173"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫What kind of herbal tea would you like to start your day with?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I have "
"some wonderful chamomile leaves, if you would like."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Con quale tipo di tisana le piacerebbe iniziare la giornata?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Ho delle "
"splendide foglie di camomilla, se vuole."

